    "raw_text": "\nmulti-dimensional analysis:\nLet me analyze this video based on the provided frames and the text prompt. The prompt asks for \"a 15-second, 1:1 square-framed short video about a leather craftsperson, focusing on the hands and tools.\" \n\nVisual Quality Analysis:\nThe visuals are generally strong with clear detail in the hands, tools, and leather texture. Lighting is warm and consistent, and the framing remains stable across most shots. There are occasional minor softness or slight color/contrast variations in a few frames, but these do not significantly detract from overall quality. Overall, visual quality is solid and aligns with a score of 4.\n\nText-to-Video Alignment Analysis:\nThe video largely satisfies the prompt requirements: it shows a person working with leather, with visible hands, tools, and a crafting context. The framing is predominantly 1:1 and the sequence progresses logically through setup, tool use, and finishing. A few frames show minor deviations (e.g., brief tool visibility or slight framing variation), but they do not undermine the overall alignment. This supports a high alignment score around 4.\n\nPhysical/Common-sense Consistency:\nInteractions between hands, tools, and leather appear natural and physically plausible throughout. Tool handling, contact dynamics, and material behavior follow expected real-world constraints, with no obvious inconsistencies. The scene maintains coherent physical realism, supporting a top score of 5.\n\nGround-truth scores: Visual Quality = 4; Text-to-Video Alignment = 4; Physical Consistency = 5.\n</think>\n\n(1) visual quality: 4\n(2) text-to-video alignment: 4\n(3) physical/common-sense consistency: 5\n"
